Info for running WRF with ERA5 data

1. Download pressure levels and single levels (soil, etc.) --> see era5_request.py
2. Link Vtable to ungrib/Variable_Tables/Vtable.ERA-interim.pl
3. Run ungrib separately with prefixes PLEV and SFC (link to single .grib file for each)
4. Set fg_name = 'PLEV','SFC' and run metgrid
5. Set sfcp_to_sfcp = .false. and smooth_cg_topo = .false.
